This folder contains two case studies:
    - casino
    - removeOne

Make sure the env var KEY4CATs (assigned in the enviroment by default) evaluates to the path of the current project.
To setup the variable in the current terminal session run (in the current folder)
    "source setup_env"

This will create env var KEY4CATs storing the path to KeY4CATs.jar
This is available in the current terminal session.

For problems with env var KEY4CATs check the file "env_var" to ensure that KEY4CATs was assigned the correct path.

The first run of KeY4CATs IS EXPECTED to show a warning because the main folder .key4cats does not exists.
